flowchart TB
  T[Bearer token] --> P["parse WITHOUT trusting:<br/>read iss, alg"]
  P --> Q{iss?}
  Q -->|"= gateway issuer"| O["verify ES256 only<br/>with the gateway's key ring (by kid)"]
  Q -->|"= OIDC issuer"| K["verify RS256 only<br/>with the IdP's JWKS"]
  Q -->|"none / sentinel-dev, alg HS256,<br/>dev issuer enabled"| D[verify HS256<br/>dev secret]
  Q -->|anything else| X[401 untrusted issuer]
  O --> OA{aud is a service audience?}
  K --> KA{aud ∋ sentinel-api?}
  D --> DA{aud is NOT a service audience?}
  OA -->|yes| S[service principal<br/>→ /mcp, alerts webhook]
  KA -->|yes| U[user principal<br/>→ /api/v1/*]
  DA -->|yes| U
  OA & KA & DA -->|no| X
